Package: visualizeGO
Type: Package
Title: Hierarchical clustered visualization of GO terms
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "María", "Alonso-García",
      email = "maalg@unileon.es",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: This package creates hierarchical graphs of interesting GO terms. This R package has been developed for the purpose of creating hierarchical graphs of a list of interesting GO-terms. 
  The package utilises a clustering method to group the GO-terms, thereby facilitating the observation of relationships between these terms. 
  This process enhances the comprehension of the intra-cluster relationships of the metabolic pathways highlighted.
  This package provides access to various data files, including Excel and RData files, that can be used for analysis. These files are stored in the inst/extdata/ directory and can be accessed using package functions.
